 'South coast beaches & Yala safari private tour', 'Six days between Galle, Mirissa and Yala with a private driver, planned around you.',
 true, 'published', 4),

('sri-lanka-wildlife-safari', 'Sri Lanka Wildlife Safari',
 'Elephants at Minneriya, Udawalawe''s herds and leopards in Yala.',
 'A wildlife-focused journey through three of Sri Lanka''s best national parks. Watch elephants gather at the Minneriya reservoir, see young elephants at the Udawalawe transit home and search for leopard and sloth bear in Yala. Safari timings are planned around park seasons.',
 array['wildlife', 'adventure'], 6, 5,
 array['Wildlife lovers', 'Families', 'Photographers'], array['Car', 'SUV', 'Van'], 10, 'QUOTE_ONLY',
 array['Private air-conditioned vehicle with English-speaking driver', 'Fuel, parking and highway tolls', 'Airport pickup and drop-off', 'Driver''s meals and accommodation'],
 array['Safari jeeps and park fees', 'Accommodation unless arranged in your quotation', 'Meals', 'Personal expenses and tips'],
 '[{"name":"Safari jeeps with park fees","description":"Minneriya or Kaudulla, Udawalawe and Yala"},{"name":"Full-day Yala safari","description":"Packed breakfast and lunch"}]'::jsonb,
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621847473222-d85c022cbf07', 'A leopard standing in water in Yala National Park', 'Photo: Udara Karunarathna / Unsplash',
 'Sri Lanka wildlife safari tour: Minneriya, Udawalawe, Yala', 'Six-day private wildlife tour with your own driver: elephants at Minneriya and Udawalawe, leopards in Yala.',
 false, 'published', 5),

('sri-lanka-honeymoon', 'Sri Lanka Honeymoon',
 'Misty tea country, the scenic train and slow beach days for two.',
 'A relaxed route for couples: a few cool days in the hills with tea estates and waterfalls, the famous train ride to Ella, then time to unwind on the south coast. We suggest boutique stays and leave plenty of free time.',
 array['honeymoon', 'hill-country', 'beach', 'scenic-train'], 8, 7,
