 true, 'published', 6),

('east-coast-summer-escape', 'East Coast Summer Escape',
 'Trincomalee''s calm summer seas and the surf town of Arugam Bay.',
 'When the south and west coasts are windy (roughly May to September), the east coast is at its best. Combine Sigiriya with Trincomalee''s beaches, snorkelling at Pigeon Island and a few days in laid-back Arugam Bay.',
 array['beach', 'adventure', 'cultural'], 7, 6,
 array['Couples', 'Friends', 'Surfers'], array['Car', 'SUV', 'Van'], 10, 'QUOTE_ONLY',
 array['Private air-conditioned vehicle with English-speaking driver', 'Fuel, parking and highway tolls', 'Airport pickup and drop-off', 'Driver''s meals and accommodation'],
 array['Accommodation unless arranged in your quotation', 'Boat trips and snorkelling', 'Entrance tickets', 'Meals', 'Personal expenses and tips'],
