 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552055568-f8c4fb8c6320', 'Aerial view of fishing boats on the shore at Arugam Bay', 'Photo: Tomáš Malík / Unsplash',
 'East coast Sri Lanka tour: Trincomalee & Arugam Bay', 'A 7-day private summer tour of Sri Lanka''s east coast: Sigiriya, Trincomalee and Arugam Bay.',
 false, 'published', 7),

('kandy-and-tea-country-short-break', 'Kandy & Tea Country Short Break',
