('galle-day-trip-from-colombo', 'Galle & South Coast Day Trip',
 'Galle Fort, stilt fishermen and a beach stop, returning the same evening.',
 'A full day down the Southern Expressway from Colombo or Negombo. Walk the ramparts of the Dutch-era Galle Fort, see the stilt fishermen near Koggala and stop at a turtle hatchery or a quiet beach on the way back.',
 array['day-trip', 'cultural', 'beach'], 1, 0,
