 'Galle day trip from Colombo with private driver', 'A private day trip from Colombo or Negombo to Galle Fort and the south coast, back the same evening.',
 false, 'published', 10),

('sigiriya-and-dambulla-day-trip', 'Sigiriya & Dambulla Day Trip',
 'Climb the Lion Rock and visit the Golden Cave Temple in one long day.',
