 'Sigiriya & Dambulla day trip with private driver', 'A private day trip to Sigiriya Rock and the Dambulla cave temples from Colombo, Negombo or Kandy.',
 false, 'published', 11),

('colombo-city-tour', 'Colombo City Tour',
 'Temples, colonial streets, markets and the seafront in a half or full day.',
 'See Sri Lanka''s capital with a driver who knows it: Gangaramaya Temple, Pettah market, the old Fort district, Independence Square and sunset at Galle Face Green. Ideal on arrival or before a late flight.',
